        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "Product",
        "category": "RealEstate",
        "description": "An unparalleled sanctuary of elegance and sophistication, 'The Cambridge Estate' is nestled on nearly 3 private acres at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac. Designed by Z+ Architects, this brand new home is estimated to be complete late 2026/early 2027. Enter through the front gates into a world of opulence across approximately 15,000sf with an elevator servicing all 3 levels, ensuring effortless accessibility. Car enthusiasts will enjoy 11-car garage parking. Inside, discover 6 sumptuous bedrooms \u0026amp; 7 full plus 3 half bathrooms, 3 fireplaces, show-stopping kitchen w La Cornue range and a 2nd prep-kitchen crowned by a 4,000-bottle wine room. Primary suite features dual WCs, separate vanity areas, 2 spa showers, infinity tub, \u0026amp; Himalayan salt sauna with integrated red light therapy. State-of-the-art gym \u0026amp; home theater. Outdoor pool pavilion with heated pool \u0026amp; spa, bluestone patios, outdoor kitchen, covered loggias \u0026amp; private tennis court. This estate is a statement of prestige \u0026amp; a testament to an unparalleled lifestyle.",
